  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promote Indigenous Women&apos;s Health in Rural Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of SVH&apos;s Women&apos;s Health Program is to improve women&apos;s access to reproductive health care and information so that they are able to adopt preventative practices and feel empowered to make informed decisions about their bodies. By training health workers in Women&apos;s Health, this program will give women in remote, indigenous communities in Peru life changing education about really important topics like menstrual hygiene, contraception methods, pre- and post-natal care, and breastfeeding.</narrative>
  </description>
